-# Shown to a member on their own profile when they have no email we can use.
.alert.alert-info{ role: 'status' }
  - if member.pending_reconfirmation?
    %strong We're waiting for you to confirm your email address.
    We sent a link to #{member.unconfirmed_email}. Follow it and we'll start sending you reminders.
  - else
    %strong You haven't set an email address.
    Add one to get planting reminders and to be able to reset your password.
    We'll send you a link to confirm it first, because we can't take your word for it.
    = link_to 'Add your email', edit_member_registration_path(anchor: 'email'), class: 'alert-link'
